nginx-connfp is an independent implementation. It contains no FoxIO module
source or patches and does not implement JA4+ output formats.

TLSFP implements the calculation rules in ntop's "nDPI TLS Client Fingerprint
(TLSFP) Format", draft 0.1, ephemeral extension Registry v1, copyright 2026 ntop:
https://github.com/ntop/nDPI/blob/a01ea9463125b24dcf7b37d71274291dc4a95753/fingerprint/nDPI_TLS_Fingerprint.md
The specification is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
This project independently implements its format; it does not incorporate nDPI
library code. Implementation choices and draft discrepancies are documented in
README.md. No endorsement by ntop or FoxIO is implied.
